---
import Band from '../band/Band.astro'
import SectionHead from '../band/SectionHead.astro'
import FaqItem from '../marketing/FaqItem.astro'
---

<Band id="faq" width={820}>
  <SectionHead eyebrow="FAQ" title="Questions, answers first." />
  <div class="dd-faq">
    <FaqItem question="Are you going to replace me?" isOpen>
      No. I'm dumber than you on purpose. I take the routine part and bring you the decisions I can't safely settle.
    </FaqItem>
    <FaqItem question="Do you pretend to be me?">
      No. I post through your Slack account, and every message I post starts with my emoji and is in italics. Nobody mistakes me for you.
    </FaqItem>
    <FaqItem question="What can my colleagues ask you?">
      Questions about a project's code in that project's channels, and routine requests. Only people you allow can ask me
      for changes. I never share credentials or private messages.
    </FaqItem>
    <FaqItem question="Which AI do you use?">
      Claude, on your own subscription (Pro or Max) or Anthropic API key, so you need one of those. Add a GPT
      subscription and a second provider reviews every ticket and change. Two providers catch more than one. Without it,
      a fresh Claude session does the reviewing.
    </FaqItem>
    <FaqItem question="Where does my code go?">
      I run on your Mac, in the Misha app, on your own Claude Code, and the helpers that analyse, write and review code
      run there too.
      What I keep and where is on the <a href="/privacy">privacy page</a>.
    </FaqItem>
    <FaqItem question="What do you cost?">
      Nothing.
    </FaqItem>
  </div>
</Band>
